window.products.push({"id":772025,"name":"Kid's Cushioned Storage Bench with 3 Basket Bins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":123.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VLM+lRs2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description A comfortable bench with ample storage below to organize toys, stuffed animals, clothes, videos, games, linens, towels, and more. Classy, durable, wipe clean, faux leather covering on cushion and bins. Sized for children to enjoy as a reading spot, or a place to perch while dressing and putting on shoes. Convenient for kids’ rooms at the end of a bed or under a window; or hallways, foyers, guest rooms, and more. Wood frame measures 45. 25\" W x 15. 75\" D x 11. 75\" H. With the cushion, the unit is 13. 75\" H. Cubby areas are each 14. 25\" W x 15\" D x 7. 75\" H. Bins/baskets measure 4\" W x 15\" D x 7. 5\" H. Card holders on front of bins allow you to label them and know what is inside at a glance. Handles on the front of the bins make it a breeze for even the smallest hands to pull open to search the treasures inside. Bins are reinforced with binding on all edges. The bins are fully removable for use anywhere in the house, and they fold flat for storage if not being used. Solid back panel prevents the baskets or other contents from being pushed out the back Top cushion is secured to the top panel which can be lifted/removed like a lid allowing full view of everything inside. Bench supports up to 200 pounds. Bench made of made of engineered wood. Wipe clean with a damp cloth and mild detergent and dry thoroughly. Wipe clean fabric is Polyurethane Leather; inside the bins is 65% Polyester/35% Cotton fabric lining. Cushioning is one inch thick polyurethane foam. Wipe/spot clean the bins as needed. Never immerse in water. Adult assembly required. Illustrated instructions included. This item ships in its original carton which may include a photo of the product. All measurements approximate. Product may vary slightly from shown. Props and accessories shown with the unit are for illustration purposes only and not included. From the Manufacturer Badger Basket's Kid's Storage Bench is a thickly cushioned bench for children with ample storage to organize toys, stuffed animals, blankets, and more. A nice place to perch and read, a thinking spot for time-outs, or have a seat to put on shoes. Fits nicely under a window or at the end of a bed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VLM+lRs2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Badger Basket","source_asin":"B005WOH0HA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005WOH0HA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005WOH0HA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
