window.products.push({"id":772109,"name":"Erioscar set of 2 Decorative Candle Lantern with Timer, Decorative Lantern Using Battery(Included), Outdoor and Indoor Hanging LED Flashing warm Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+Oj2xsneL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specifications Product Type: Flameless Candle Lantern Material: Plastic, Glass, Plastic (Candle) Finish: Metallic Coating, Black, Ivory (Candle) Light Source: LED LED Color: Warm White Power Source: Battery Battery Type: AAA (3 per lantern) Batteries Included: Yes Lantern Dimensions: 6.1\"L x 6.1\"W x 10.1\"H  Candle Dimensions: 2.9\"L x 2.9\"W x3.1\"H Candle Type: Pillar Is Candle Removable: No (Fixed in Lantern) Switch Options: On/Off,8/16 Hour Timer Weather Resistant: Yes Application: Indoor & Outdoor Use Intended Use: Ambient Mood Lighting / Outdoor Decor, Patio and Yard Furniture Versatile & Portable 1. Sits on any surface, or can be hung using the integrated hanging loop. 2. An eye-catching display for the table, yard, wall, pathway, driveway, shelf, patio, porch, dresser, etc. 3. Fabulous decor item for both indoors and covered outdoors. 4. Features a convenient 8-hour on, 16-hour off timer - will automatically turn on/off at the same time every day. 5. Perfect for daily decor, anniversaries, weddings, Halloween, etc. IP44 Waterproof For Indoor & Outdoor Use 1. Completed with a closed design, this lantern cannot be opened but features IP44 waterproof for protection against the weather. 2. A movable HANGING RING for easy hanging, or sits on a flat surface. 3. Let you enjoy the ambiance of candlelight safely without the actual danger of an open flame. Let Time Be Your Convenience 1. With the SET-AND-FORGET timer functioned, the candle can be left on and will stay on for 8 hours and then remains off for 16 hours, only to automatically light up your home again for 8 hours, simply by switching at the bottom of the lantern. 2. When the timer is not in use, just turn ON or OFF the lantern as a regular light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+Oj2xsneL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erioscar","source_asin":"B08S3SKFSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S3SKFSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S3SKFSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
