window.products.push({"id":772112,"name":"Large Nonstick Electric Skillet - Serves 4 to 6 People (Copper Ceramic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":138.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAeTn5MDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This versatile 15\" Copper Ceramic Electric Skillet lets you fry, saute, simmer or sear on a copper ceramicbased nonstick surface, allowing healthier cooking without oils or fats. The generous 15\" nonstick cookware easily accommodates large batches of everything from pancakes to meatballs, fried chicken, scrambled eggs, burgers, steaks and more. Great for countertop cooking or buffet serving, the electric skillet's heat disperses evenly for easy temperature control and consistent browning. Tempered glass lid allows you to easily see cooking progress. Includes 5 temperature settings, 15\" L x 15\" W with 12\" x 12\" lid. Cautions : Hand wash, do not immerse in water!!! Think about it. What are the 3 most frustrating things about frying? 1. Grease ail over the place. 2. Food stuck to your skillet. 3. Endless hours of scrubbing. Well, now you don't have to waste your time, effort and food anymore, since we have exactly what you need! Now you can spend less time scrubbing your non-stick fry pan and more time enjoying your delicious pancakes, steaks or scrambled eggs thanks to our convenient and hassle-free electric fry pan! Save your precious time and effort by choosing our electric skillet and surprise your family with the most mouth-watering fried delights Sticky Business - our electric pan features non-stick inner coating that will prevent your food from getting stuck and make sure that your steaks, pancakes or burgers come out intact. Cleaning - no need to scrub for hours, since our non-stick surface is super-easy to clean. All you need is a soft dish cloth. That's it! CONVENIENT GLASS LID ERCONOMIC HANDLES Prevent burning or messy accidents with the sturdy and heat-resistant handles. ELECTRIC COOKER SPECS Size: 15\" x 15\" x 4\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAeTn5MDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nozaya","source_asin":"B0BKZ5Y5DD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ5Y5DD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ5Y5DD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
