window.products.push({"id":772205,"name":"KitchenAid KFC3100WH Chef Series 3-Cup Food Chopper, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tw6eLBfvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Say good-bye to hours spent chopping, dicing and shredding with this chef's chopper by KitchenAid. Large 3-cup capacity is great for sauces and soups yet compact enough for smaller, everyday jobs. The premium, razor-sharp blade handles meat, nuts, hard cheeses and vegetables as well as fresh herbs, fruit and more. The unique lid design includes wet and dry compartments for adding ingredients as you're processing. Removable parts are dishwasher safe. Manual includes delicious recipes to get you started. Imported. 10Hx5Wx6D.\" Amazon.com With a 3-cup work bowl and 240 watts of power, this chopper is ideal for small jobs and for making sauces, frostings, and dressings. The stainless-steel blade's reverse spiral action pulls food down, minimizing scraping and producing uniform chopped meat, nuts, cheese, vegetables, herbs--all the many foods for which the chopper is intended. For adding ingredients while the chopper is running, the lid has two compartments, one for dry items and the other for wet. For precise control, the chopper's electronic pulse pad responds instantaneously. The heavy power base provides stability and is seamless, making cleanup a simple matter of wiping the base and placing all the parts in the dishwasher. The chopper stands just 9-1/2 inches high and has cord storage inside the base. A stiff spatula is included. Should the chopper fail during its first year, KitchenAid's total replacement warranty guarantees delivery of another machine. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tw6eLBfvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00005LA9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005LA9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005LA9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":772206,"name":"COSTWAY Juicer Machines with 2.5inch Wide Mouth, 400W Masticating Juicer Extractor with Dual Speed Control and Overload Protection, Stainless Steel Ce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LQ5snymOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🥝【Wide Feed Chute & High Juice Yield】Juicer machines with the 2.5inch wide feed chute can easily receive large pieces of fruits and vegetables, greatly reducing the preparation time. Efficient motor and sharp chopping blades can quickly extract delicious and nutritious juice. In addition, the juicer is also equipped with a 1300ml pulp collector and a 350ml juice cup for convenient use. 🍎【Dual Speed Modes & Anti-drip Function】This masticating juicer extractor has two speed modes. \"I\" is weakly grinding, suitable for oranges, tomatoes and other soft fruits or vegetables. \"II\" is strong grinding, suitable for hard food such as apples, carrots, gingers and so on. The anti-drip outlet can effectively prevent the juice from spilling to keep your counter surface clean. 🍐【Multiple Safety Protection】Our centrifugal juicer is specially designed with a safety lock unit and will not start unless all parts are properly assembled. It also adopts a high-speed electric motor with overload protection. When the motor is overheated, the power will be automatically cut off, which can prolong the service life of the machine. 🍊【Food Grade Healthy Materials】Made of food-grade antioxidant materials and has passed ETL certification, our centrifugal juicer machine is non-toxic and odorless to ensure your drinking safety. In addition, the sturdy and durable stainless steel body can provide years of service. 🥭【Easy to Assemble and Clean】With intuitive illustrations and clear instructions, only a few simple steps are required to assemble this juicer machine. All detachable parts can be rinsed with water directly and the stainless steel body can be quickly wiped clean with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LQ5snymOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B083FM2V11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FM2V11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083FM2V11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
