window.products.push({"id":772393,"name":"Thang Long Vietnamese Coffee Filter Maker Press. Screw Down Phin Made in Vietnam. Authentic (1, Medium (8 oz))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915q06Ygg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SCREW DOWN VIETNAMESE COFFEE FILTER This is a 4 piece Vietnamese Coffee Filter. Pieces include- brew chamber, screw down insert, drip tray, & lid. Quality, robust, smooth screw down mechanism acts as a coffee press allowing you to pack the coffee the desired amount. This allows you to control the strength of the brew. Packaged in a beautiful box with detailed instruction sheet. HIGH QUALITY This Thang Long Vietnamese Coffee Filter is made in Vietnam with high quality stainless steel. You may find cheaper filters but the quality will likely be inferior. Why not pay a touch more for this quality Vietnamese Coffee Maker that will last a lifetime (backed by a lifetime warranty)? Dishwasher safe. VIETNAMESE COFFEE DRIPPER Drip coffee is an awesome technique to brew coffee & the brewing process for this drip filter takes about 4-5 minutes. Watch & smell in mouth watering anticipation. Have fun & show your friends this interesting technique which is environmentally friendly, requires little storage space, is portable, & easy to clean. Great for home, the office, travelling, & camping. DELICIOUS COFFEE Why pay $5 at a local Vietnamese restaurant when you can make delicious Vietnamese coffee with this strainer from your home? Works well with traditional Vietnamese Coffee such as Trung Nguyen, or grind your own other favourite coffee (use a medium-coarse grind). Make the perfect Vietnamese Iced Coffee (Caphe Sua Da), you will be in heaven! PERFECT SIZE This phin filter is a one cup individual coffee maker. 8 oz is our best selling size & brews about 6-7 oz of coffee. More water can easily be added (once some filters through) if desired. Fits on most cups/mugs- refer to photo on left for dimensions. We’re so confident that you’ll love our filter that if you’re not happy you can return it for a full refund. Start enjoying today & consider a 2 pack as a gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915q06Ygg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thang Long","source_asin":"B07K3QCYHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K3QCYHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K3QCYHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":772394,"name":"Northlight 7-Count Clear Retro Christmas Bubble Light Set, 6ft Green Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu5kWX0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These unique bubble lights will shine brightly in your tree. The bulb shines in the base, lighting up the bubbling support! When the lights start to bubble, the silver glitter inside of the bubbler moves around and glistens with the light. It can be used on your Christmas tree, or outside in your bushes. Product Features:. Color: clear bulb / green wire. Number of bulbs on string: 7. Spacing between each light: 12\" Lighted string length: 6' Total string length: 7' Wire gauge: 20 Additional Product Features: If one bulb goes out the rest will stay lit When bubbles appear silver glitter is pushed around the inside of the bubbler Each light has a clip on their base so you can easily attach the lights to your tree or other desired surfaces. Minor assembly required. UL listed for indoor use only. Designed with a brass bass. Allow time for the liquid to heat before bubbles appear End-to-end connectors allow you to connect multiple sets together (not to exceed 210 watts) 120 volts, 60 hertz, 0.28 amps, 35 watts Dimensions: 4.5\" high x 2\" diameter. Material(s): plastic/glass/wire/water/glitter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu5kWX0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B07HY72ST2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HY72ST2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HY72ST2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":772395,"name":"Department 56 Elf the Movie Village Accessory Snowball Fight Figurine, 2.75 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813vgGr-hZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas Evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country Inn nestled in a quiet River town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All Evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history. Department 56 knows the importance of celebrating the holidays with family and friends. Savor your time together and make it extra special with Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813vgGr-hZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A0XY8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A0XY8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A0XY8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
