window.products.push({"id":772593,"name":"Memory Foam Pillow for Sleeping, Arched Cuddle Cervical Pillow, Bed Couples Side Sleeper Pillows for Eco Gel Arm Pillows for Sleeping (Left)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vjc9uGFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👫 【THREE STANDARDS】Height standard, cater to the curve of cervical spine; Softness and hardness standard, improve sleep comfort; Support standard, support neck, head, shoulder, arms to adjust sleep. Best neck & cervical Pillows.🍁 The Product is vaccum-compressed and takes some times to totally recover after unpacking🍁 👫 【ARCHED CUDDLE PILLOW】Arch design, contour sweet couples pillow offers the best support for your mates neck, head, shoulder, arm, lumbar, back support and Pillow with arm tunnel for side sleeping. 👫 【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】L-shaped design relieves the pressure of the arms. Ergonomic design to relieve neck pain and stress. Suitable for back / side sleepers, lumbar support and arm rest. 👫 【REBOUND MEMORY FOAM】Pure breathable memory foam, keep original shape, soft but firm enough for neck and head support. High softness, excellent recovery performance, protection to neck, arm, head and other contact parts. 👫 【HELPFUL FOR SLEEPING】The neck pillow is soft with great support. The curved design of the pillow keeps your neck relaxed during sleep. For sleeping, you can take it as a normal cervical neck bed pillow as well as an couple arm pillow. 👫 【TUNNEL DESIGN】The side sleeper pillow use the tunnel sharped design,which helps users to place their hands and shoulders where nowhere is placed by using the memory foam pillow with 0 pressure. It is perfect pillow for back, side or front sleepers. It eases the arm pressure. 👫 【DESIGNED COUPLE CUDDLE PILLOWS】This sweet couples pillow with pillow arm tunnel is specially designed for Mr and Mrs. It will provide the accompany of couples comfort and warm. The advanced arm pillows with arm tunnel for side sleeping. 👫 【BREATHABLE & REMOVABLE】The Ice silk pillowcase with invisible zipper is easy to disassemble. the Memory foam is covered with inner cover. Do not worry about the body of pillow, if necessary, wash the pillowcase. Just take off the removable pillow cover, throwing into your washing machine when you doing laundry, then you can get fresh and clean one. 👫 【PERFECT GIFTS】Memory foam pillows for sleeping are simple in shape and practical, very suitable for use in bed, office, home or travel.There are two Options for Left- and Right- Hand Users. It is an ideal choice for people with sleep disorders and a good gift to increase the emotional connection between couples. 👫 【EXCELLENT CUSTOMER SERVICE】Heartbeat is a company that produces bedding products. Customer satisfaction is our priority, if you have any questions need our help, please send a simple email, we accept any reason, any time of return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vjc9uGFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heartbeat","source_asin":"B089ZVZ9DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089ZVZ9DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089ZVZ9DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
