window.products.push({"id":772795,"name":"ASOGO Bamboo Cheese Board Set - Extra Large Charcuterie Board Set - House Warming, Anniversary, Wedding Gifts for Couple, Bridal Shower Gift for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gSlji9IPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast and Fabulous Entertaining - Impress your guests with our premium charcuterie set. Our meat and cheese board is the perfect size for displaying a variety of delicious options that go way beyond traditional finger foods. Welcome guests with a beautiful cheese serving board filled with a colorful and tasty array of appetizing offerings. Our large cheese board set will add simplicity to your life while offering incredible versatility and functionality. Party Like a Pro - We specialize in cheese boards with a ton of beneficial features to make entertaining fun and easy. Our serving board is the perfect size for displaying a variety of delicious delectables including meats, cheeses of various textures, crackers, veggies, fruit, jellies and jams, dips, and more. Welcome guests with our beautiful wood cheese board filled with a colorful and tasty array of appetizing offerings. Much More Than a Cheese Board - We include a matching square bamboo fruit tray for added versatility and functionality. Enjoy our free guide booklet offering design suggestions and ideas for board use. Our product comes in a sturdy decorative box for instant gifting. we make simple things better and our cheese board is sure to become a reliable favorite for entertaining and serving. Bountiful Benefits of Bamboo - You'll feel great about purchasing an earth friendly material that is properly sourced and highly renewable. Bamboo is nonporous and resists liquid so it won't bend, warp, crack, absorb odor, or stain. A truly low maintenance wood for a user-friendly experience. But the obvious benefit is its natural aesthetic value. Enjoy the Best Life Has to Offer - Gathering with friends and family over food and drinks is one of life's most enjoyable experiences. Our unique and beautiful board, with so many beneficial features and accompanying accessories. Enjoy our free guide booklet offering design suggestions and ideas for board use. At Smirly, we make simple things better, and our cheese board is sure to become a reliable favorite for entertaining and serving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gSlji9IPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASOGO","source_asin":"B09ZY7W3ML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZY7W3ML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZY7W3ML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
