window.products.push({"id":772802,"name":"Koolnfun 5 Wine Stoppers - Perfect Wine Gift Accessory, Set of 5 Funny Silicone Wine Reusable Caps Stoppers for Wine and Beer Bottles - VinoLuvr Wine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719NJrOlO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’re finally home after a long day working and sitting in traffic. Time to put your feet up with a glass of your favorite wine but you’re all alone and you don’t want to finish a whole bottle alone. Keep your open wine fresh in the refrigerator by replacing the cork with a VinoLuvr wine stopper. Drink your wine and have it too! If you’ve opened a simply replace it with a funny branded image stopper. COULDN’T BE EASIER! Made of food grade silicone, they are completely LEAK PROOF and AIRTIGHT, exactly what you need when you’ve only drunk some of the bottle. Keep the oxygen out and the wine in so your wine stays fresh and tasty for days. They are reusable, durable and easy to clean (put them in the dishwasher). They fit all standard wine, Champagne, beer and soda bottles. We take our wine seriously so we have created a set of 5 silicone VinoLuvr wine stoppers, so you see which wines you’ve opened in the blink of an eye. A gift which is suitable for anyone over the age of 21! For Mom & Dad, Friends, Family, Co-Workers, Employees or the Boss. Birthdays, Anniversaries, Mothers day, Fathers day, Housewarming or Holidays. Whatever the occasion this is the absolute best gift. Oh, and don’t forget to get a set for yourself. BUY NOW - you’ll never have to run out to buy a last-minute gift again! PACKAGE INCLUDES: Each order is a 5 Pack of VinoLuvr Silicone Wine Stoppers with the Funny humor and Colors shown in Pictures.  A wine stopper is an essential wine accessory to close leftover wine bottles before refrigerating them. Reusable * Air-tight seal * Easy to clean * Leak Proof * Easy to use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719NJrOlO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VinoLuvr","source_asin":"B07D7M1N4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7M1N4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7M1N4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
