window.products.push({"id":772903,"name":"St Patricks Day Decorations Indoor, 5PCS Tiered Tray Decor, Happy St. Patricks Day Wooden Signs, Golden Pot, Kiss Me I'm Irish Hat, Welcome Shamrock B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nk4TT5JgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feeling lucky? It could be the luck of the Irish. After all, everyone is Irish on St. Patrick's Day. On March 17, there's much to do from cooking corned beef and cabbage and donning your finest green attire to raising a glass in honor of Irish pride. You can also decorate as part of the festivities. These decorations not only make your home more attractive, but also add a festive atmosphere to your celebrations. It is a great way to show off your tradition or support Irish culture. Features: St Patrick's Day tray decor is attractive and exquisite, these symbols represent good wishes, bringing you luck, health, happiness. Farmhouse St Patrick's Day decor is chic decoration for bedroom, living room, dining room, tray decor, table, shelf, office, store, coffee bar and can match well with most of your home decorations, making your home full of fresh and farmhouse touch. Specifications: Material: wood Color: mainly green and white Size: as the picture shown Package includes: Happy St.Patricks Day sign x1 Welcome Shamrock block x1 Kiss Me I'm Irish hat block x1 Loads of Luck truck x1 Golden Pot x1 Notes: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The color may exist a slight difference due to different screen displays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nk4TT5JgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vintend","source_asin":"B0C3VF4YV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3VF4YV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3VF4YV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":772904,"name":"Yunbaoit Visual Timer with Night Light, 60-Minute Countdown Timer for Kids and Adults, Silent Classroom Timer, Time Management Tool for Home, School, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rZm1HkE8L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Time Management Tool】 Do you or your kids have trouble with procrastination or poor time sense? Yunbaoit timer can help people cultivate a sense of time. This timer is a visual time management tool that makes you feel like time is visible as the colored disk disappears and the time disappears clearly. Sensing time allows you to study and work efficiently. 【Simple Setting】 All you need to do is twist the setting knob clockwise to simply set the countdown you need. When the colored disk reaches “0”, the time ends. Then the bell will ring to remind you that the time is up. 【Stop Alarm】The visual timer has 3 ring modes： Mute, Low, and Loud. You can choose the mode you need. Compared to other timers, this timer has a touch pause function for the ringing. When the bell rings, it will ring last 30S and turn off automatically, you can press the top button to pause it to avoid the alarm sound being too short or too long. 【Mute Mode with Night Light】This upgraded version of the timer has specially added a night light mode. When you choose to mute, you can choose the night light mode. When the time is up, the night light will flash. It is very suitable for some quiet public places, such as studying at libraries or working in a Café. Or when the light is dim, you can touch the light button at the top to view the countdown time. 【Multiple Uses】The timer is lightweight and compact. It is convenient for you to carry around. You can use it for various occasions. For example, cooking, baking, learning, or fitness. It will be a good helper in your life. It will be a wonderful kitchen timer, study timer, and work timer. If you have any problems with the product， you can consult us in time. We will make effort to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rZm1HkE8L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yunbaoit","source_asin":"B0BNXF324J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-772904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNXF324J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNXF324J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
